title:: BMSelectInsOutsGUI
summary:: Documentation BEASTmulch - a GUI for selecting inputs and outputs
categories:: Classes

Description::

BMSelectInsOutsGUI is a modal sheet which allows you to select subsets of inputs and outputs from supplied lists.

See also: link::Classes/Inputs and Outputs/BMInOutArray::

CLASSMETHODS::

method:: new
Create a new BMSelectInsOutsGUI.
		
argument:: parent
The parent window to which this sheet will be attached.
argument:: ins
A link::Classes/Inputs and Outputs/BMInOutArray::.
argument:: outs
A link::Classes/Inputs and Outputs/BMInOutArray::.
argument:: okFunc
A link::Classes/Function:: that will be evaluated when the sheet is closed. This will be passed two BMInOutArrays, inResults and outResults, as arguments.
		

Examples

(
w = Window("Dummy Parent", Rect(400, 400, 400, 400)).front; // a blank window to attach this to
BMSelectInsOutsGUI(w, s.insAsBMInOutArray, s.outsAsBMInOutArray, {|ins, outs|
	"ins %\n".postf(ins);
	"outs %\n".postf(outs);
});
)
